 * both the exact module name (`"typeorm"`) and any sub-path (`"typeorm/..."`),
 * and recognizes ESM `import`, TypeScript `import = require(...)`, and
 * CommonJS `require(...)` forms so that `.js`/`.jsx` callers still pass the
 * scope guard.
 */
